  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting peace and reconciliation amongst border communities in Cyangugu,  Bukavu and Uvira</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to peaceful coexistence amongst communities living in Cyangugu (Rwanda), Bukavu
&amp; Uvira (DRC) dioceses. In coordination with the 3 dioceses, the project will sensitize communities on peaceful coexistence through publications in local languages, radio broadcasts and actively engage decision makers&#x2019;
commitment to peace through a sustained advocacy strategy.
Socio-cultural events including theatres and sports activities will be organized in order to bring together communities across the border.
The project will also facilitate learning and exchange through workshops with stakeholders across the border, in coordination with Bukavu and Uvira dioceses. Lastly, the project has identified the important role of Apostolic workers in the targeted dioceses on AFRICAE MUNUS, in order to develop a strong church participation in peace initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
